{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14219190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14219190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1421919001:1":{"text":"상자가 열렸어! 안에! ......","source_cn":"盒子打开了！里面是！……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C005D97FD5991DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421919002:0":{"text":"...망치? 평범한 망치 같은데...","source_cn":"是……一把小锤子？看样子就是普通的小铁锤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3098BB0F3C2F949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421919003:1":{"text":"선조가 나에게 남긴 보물이... 이 망치였구나...","source_cn":"先祖留给俺的宝物……是这把小铁锤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FCB6AA68F4B71C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421919004:0":{"text":"드루, 크게 실망한 것 같은데?","source_cn":"德鲁是不是大失所望了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE14940D19B58C98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421919005:1":{"text":"아니, 실망하지 않았어... 보물이 있다는 걸 안 뒤로 내가 나답지 않게 변했었어...","source_cn":"不，俺不失望……自从俺知道有宝物，俺就变得不像俺了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE43792F76E028DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421919006:1":{"text":"이건 선조가 제작하신 첫 번째 망치야. 이걸 남기신 건 제작의 초심을 잊지 말라는 뜻이겠지...","source_cn":"这是先祖锻造的第一把锤子，先祖这是在告诉俺，别忘了锻造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35185CED87973E08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421919007:1":{"text":"이 망치는 가장 중요한 건 보물이 아니라 처음 그걸 만들 때의 즐거움이라는 걸 알려주고 있군.","source_cn":"它告诉俺，最重要的根本不是宝物，而是最开始锻造时的快乐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B0B6EDB6A89682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421919008:1":{"text":"난 이익을 바라고 보물을 찾았지만 당신들은 당시 무슨 일이 있는지 알기 위해 나를 도와주었지.","source_cn":"俺找宝物是因为有利可图，但你们帮我，却是为了知道当年究...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFB1E8C12D47C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421919009:1":{"text":"오랜 세월 동안 선조의 유적을 돌봤지만 결국 여러분이 선조가 진짜 남긴 게 뭔지 나에게 알려주었군... 정말 부끄럽소.","source_cn":"俺照看了这么多年先祖的遗迹，最后却是通过你们才知道先祖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F688725961231A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421919010:1":{"text":"여러분이 말한 고고학의 의미를 조금은 알겠소.","source_cn":"你们说的考古的意思，俺慢慢的有点知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B7A686C5581F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421919011:1":{"text":"고고학자, 부탁이 하나 있소. 더 많은 사람들에게 우리 선조의 일을 알려주겠소? 그가 쓴 내용, 또 망치와 함께...","source_cn":"考古学家，俺有一个请求，能不能让更多人知道俺先祖的事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x036DDA05CF8D9439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421919012:1":{"text":"물론이죠! 그건 우리가 계속 해온 일이거든요! 더 많은 사람들에게 유물의 배경을 알려주는 일이요!","source_cn":"当然！这就是我们一直在做的工作——让更多人知道这些文物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x271627E4D233BCD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421919013:1":{"text":"그런데 이 유물을 더 자세히 연구하려면 학회에 가져가야 하는데 빌려주실 수 있나요...?","source_cn":"不过如果要对这些文物做更细致的研究的话，可能需要把它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47DE8C0A68079156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421919014:1":{"text":"물론! 나보다는 여러분의 손에서 더 큰 역할을 하게 될 테니까!","source_cn":"俺愿意！它们在你们手上比在我手上能发挥的作用大多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1977B4E2BC7569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421919015:1":{"text":"드루, 정말 많이 성장했는걸!","source_cn":"德鲁，我真要对你刮目相看了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54BA2F0468709308","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421919016:1":{"text":"당당해진 기분이야. 드루 아이언하트라는 이름에 걸맞는 드워프가 된 것 같아!","source_cn":"俺现在觉得腰板都直了，俺真正配的上德鲁·铁心这个名字了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D77F1590885692E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:德鲁·铁心":{"text":"드루 아이언하트","source":"德鲁·铁心","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}